# Generated/maintained by `scripts/setup_server.py`. Contains channel/role
# IDs for the production BOON Community guild — these are NOT secrets (any
# member can see them) but they are environment-specific, so we commit them
# explicitly so Fly.io deploys ship with the live mapping. If you fork this
# repo for a different server, regenerate the file via setup_server.py before
# deploying.
